WEBVTT

01:36.650 --> 01:37.490
GWARGH!

01:37.490 --> 01:40.490
Why didn't you tell me sooner?!

01:38.200 --> 01:39.320
GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH!

01:40.490 --> 01:45.290
You incompetent fool!
You have brought shame upon me!

01:41.580 --> 01:42.450
GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH! GWARGH!

01:51.000 --> 01:53.000
In so short a time...?

01:55.210 --> 01:56.800
AIYEARGH!

01:56.800 --> 01:59.220
Gatekeeper-SAN has been killed already?

02:00.220 --> 02:04.390
I can manipulate the media into taking care of the TV footage.

02:04.390 --> 02:06.600
I will finish things with him first.

02:06.930 --> 02:09.400
Support me from the top of the tower!

02:09.400 --> 02:12.360
This is your last chance!

02:12.360 --> 02:15.440
W-With pleasure!

02:33.670 --> 02:39.970
NINJA Slayer-SAN, I have taken control of 70% of the tower.

02:39.970 --> 02:41.220
Nancy-SAN?

02:41.220 --> 02:44.260
Your prey is in the OFFLINE SPACE.

02:41.220 --> 02:44.260
NOTE: In OFFLINE SPACE, IRC cannot exist.

02:44.510 --> 02:47.100
Unfortunately, this is as far as I can take you.

02:50.770 --> 02:53.270
Direct elevator.

02:56.190 --> 02:58.400
You have arrived.

03:34.480 --> 03:36.730
He's here.

03:37.150 --> 03:39.490
DŌMO, Laomoto-SAN.

03:39.860 --> 03:41.900
I am NINJA Slayer.

03:43.950 --> 03:46.740
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

03:46.740 --> 03:53.710
For a single rat, you've sure caused a lot of damage.

03:53.710 --> 03:56.790
A rat who bites twice can defeat even a lion.

03:56.790 --> 04:00.210
That is called... anaphylactic shock.

04:00.210 --> 04:01.220
What a poet!

04:01.220 --> 04:05.470
His splendid metaphor combines
HEIAN HAIKU with modern science!

04:01.220 --> 04:05.470
NOTE: HEIAN HAIKU is VERY JAPANESE.

04:05.470 --> 04:09.180
You're just a rat who can't keep his mouth shut.

04:09.180 --> 04:10.980
I guess I have one question.

04:11.230 --> 04:13.770
Tell me your motive.

04:14.690 --> 04:17.610
You are the hated enemy who slew my innocent wife and child.

04:17.610 --> 04:21.940
I am just one man out of the thousands you've crushed like insects.

04:21.940 --> 04:26.570
But the rage of this one man will cost you everything,

04:26.570 --> 04:27.870
including your life!

04:28.990 --> 04:32.790
Let's see if you can at least make it to me.

04:35.830 --> 04:38.090
He's standing so bold and erect.

04:38.090 --> 04:41.010
Thrusting so violently!

04:43.260 --> 04:47.470
NAMU SAN! A honey trap?! Now?!

04:47.890 --> 04:49.890
DIE!

04:51.600 --> 04:53.180
WASSHOI!

05:01.530 --> 05:02.940
YEEART!

05:13.500 --> 05:14.870
GWARRRGGGH!

05:15.120 --> 05:16.040
YEEART!

05:25.720 --> 05:27.800
GWARARARARARARGH!

05:29.010 --> 05:30.220
SAYŌNARA!

05:34.480 --> 05:38.520
Have I made it to you now, Laomoto-SAN?

05:40.400 --> 05:43.690
Very well, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

05:44.070 --> 05:46.650
But let me tell you one thing before we begin.

05:49.910 --> 05:54.080
I possess seven NINJA SOULS.

05:54.080 --> 05:55.710
Seven, you hear me?

05:56.250 --> 05:59.540
That makes me the strongest man in the world.

05:59.540 --> 06:02.420
No one can beat me.

06:02.420 --> 06:08.260
So why, then, do I bar the path to me with so many NINJA and traps?

06:08.630 --> 06:10.180
Do you know?

06:13.510 --> 06:15.310
Because I have better shit to do.

06:15.310 --> 06:19.600
The time I spend talking with you,
the time I spend playing with you...

06:19.600 --> 06:22.400
Do you have any idea how many business opportunities

06:22.400 --> 06:26.860
are escaping my valuable talents right now?

06:26.860 --> 06:31.620
The SIX GATES exist so I don't have to deal with this penny ante crap.

06:31.620 --> 06:34.240
But the SIX GATES are gone now!

06:34.240 --> 06:36.910
There is no one left to protect you.

06:36.910 --> 06:39.210
Is this a waste of time? Yes, I agree.

06:39.210 --> 06:42.210
I don't have time to spare for your boring monologue.

06:42.210 --> 06:44.840
Right now I want to make you suffer horribly,

06:44.840 --> 06:46.130
and then kill you!

06:48.630 --> 06:50.510
We're talking past each other.

06:50.510 --> 06:55.680
In the end, an INSECT on the ground cannot comprehend the mind of an EAGLE!

06:56.350 --> 06:58.850
I'll say this once more.

06:59.140 --> 07:01.230
I am the strongest!

07:01.230 --> 07:03.980
Far stronger than you!

07:04.320 --> 07:08.240
Now you'll see for yourself!

07:17.290 --> 07:21.540
Behold! What powerful PSYCHOKINESIS!

07:41.600 --> 07:44.360
Come, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

07:44.360 --> 07:48.110
You will cross the SANZU RIVER in tears,

07:44.360 --> 07:48.110
NOTE: Beyond the SANZU RIVER lies JIGOKU.

07:48.110 --> 07:51.150
and spend eternity in misery with your wife and child.

07:51.150 --> 07:52.280
YEEART!

07:53.490 --> 07:55.030
GWARGH!

08:16.300 --> 08:17.260
GWAAAARGH!

08:18.890 --> 08:19.220
YEEART!

08:19.220 --> 08:20.890
GWAAARGHH!

08:25.060 --> 08:28.230
Weak! I'm yawning over here!

08:28.730 --> 08:30.940
GWAARGGHH!

08:32.650 --> 08:33.900
YEEART!

08:33.110 --> 08:33.900
GWARGH!

08:43.370 --> 08:45.580
GOJUPPO HYAPPO.

08:45.790 --> 08:46.170
YEEART!

08:46.170 --> 08:47.590
GWARGH!

08:49.050 --> 08:53.840
This is the fate of fools who oppose me!

08:53.840 --> 08:57.430
Read your HAIKU, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

08:57.430 --> 08:58.600
I refuse!

09:02.060 --> 09:04.270
What a JOKE!

09:02.060 --> 09:04.270
NOTE: JOKES are shameful and unprofessional.

09:04.270 --> 09:08.360
In the end, you were all talk.

09:08.360 --> 09:10.940
I will kill you...

09:10.940 --> 09:11.730
GWAAARGGGH!

09:11.730 --> 09:13.860
I am the master of KARATE.

09:13.860 --> 09:17.700
I am the master of seven NINJA SOULS!
I am a REAL NINJA!

09:17.700 --> 09:19.700
I am a DEMOLITION NINJA!

09:20.030 --> 09:24.120
Someday I shall become a NINJA that surpasses NINJA!

09:24.120 --> 09:27.630
I shall be a NINJA like unto a GOD!

09:29.250 --> 09:30.960
...must be slain.

09:33.670 --> 09:36.470
NINJAS... must be slain!

09:36.470 --> 09:39.680
Do you want me to begin by cutting off your arm?

09:40.390 --> 09:42.600
Stop it, Fujikido.

09:42.600 --> 09:44.180
I won't let you...

09:44.180 --> 09:46.390
Fujikido, stop!

09:55.780 --> 09:58.280
His NINJA SOUL has gone berserk?

10:00.990 --> 10:03.790
NINJAS must be slain...

10:05.910 --> 10:07.000
Shut up!

10:07.000 --> 10:08.620
YEEART!

10:10.790 --> 10:13.250
GWAAAAARGH!

10:13.670 --> 10:16.300
You are the one who killed my wife and child.

10:16.300 --> 10:18.340
You cannot kill me.

10:18.340 --> 10:22.010
Today shall be the day you die, Laomoto-SAN!

10:22.010 --> 10:23.560
YEEART!

10:29.100 --> 10:31.770
It's a little too cramped in here.

10:31.770 --> 10:35.480
Follow me, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:35.480 --> 10:36.690
YEEART!

10:48.460 --> 10:51.500
Those black, impious flames are those of NARAKU.

10:51.500 --> 10:55.090
But Fujikido had not yielded control of his body.

10:55.090 --> 10:56.260
Then how?

10:56.760 --> 10:59.010
The answer is simple.

10:59.010 --> 11:04.100
He's burning the NARAKU NINJA SOUL itself as he fights, as if it were fuel!

11:05.760 --> 11:07.390
This weight...

11:07.390 --> 11:08.930
YEEART!

11:09.640 --> 11:11.730
GWAAAAAAARGHH!

11:12.400 --> 11:13.810
Fool!

11:13.810 --> 11:14.480
YEEART!

11:14.480 --> 11:15.770
GWARGH!

11:19.110 --> 11:20.910
Out of gas?

11:24.120 --> 11:26.580
GWARGH!

11:26.580 --> 11:28.660
Do you think me like a cheater?

11:28.660 --> 11:31.080
But battle is like business itself!

11:31.080 --> 11:34.880
It does not heed romantic notions!
The underhanded shall win!

11:34.880 --> 11:37.590
Die, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

11:45.600 --> 11:48.100
...must be slain.

11:48.100 --> 11:49.520
YEEART!

11:49.520 --> 11:53.350
This the secret IAIDŌ technique,
the CHOPPITY-CHOP!

11:49.520 --> 11:53.350
NOTE: It also affects one's CREDIT RATING.

12:15.710 --> 12:19.130
SAYŌNARA, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

12:19.510 --> 12:21.840
Now explode!

12:25.510 --> 12:27.100
Wh-What's this?

12:27.350 --> 12:29.520
BUNSHIN JUTSU?!

12:34.100 --> 12:37.230
DŌMO, Laomoto-SAN.

12:38.190 --> 12:40.440
I am NARAKU NINJA.
